// Spell
@1 = ~Summon Gorgon~
@2 = ~Summon Gorgon
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 5
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell summons a gorgon, a great bull covered in dark iron scales, to fight for the wizard. It obeys the caster until the spell ends or it is slain.

Gorgon: HP 60, AC 2, THAC0 11, 1 gore per round (2d6+2 piercing damage, +2 weapon). Once per summoning, the gorgon breathes a petrifying vapour in a 30-ft. cone in front of it: enemies caught in it must save vs. Petrification/Polymorph or be held for 2 rounds as their flesh turns to stone. Allies are not affected. The gorgon is immune to petrification and fear.~

// Creature and its breath
@3 = ~Gorgon~
@4 = ~Petrifying Breath~
